{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-02742-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["코로나맵(http://coronamap.site)에 대한 관심이 커지고 있다","이씨는 서버를 한 차례 증설했다"],"reason":"The summary keeps the 390만 views, the 15 confirmed cases and the server cost issue. It never says what 코로나맵 is, and it leaves out the 500만 forecast and the ranking. It also reads awkwardly because the 관심 clause is attached to the interview sentence."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["1일까지 누적 조회수는 390만회를 돌파했다","2일에도 확진자 3명이 추가 확인돼"],"reason":"The summary says the 390만 views were reached on 2일, but the source says the count was through 1일. It also omits the 500만 forecast, the server expansion and the cost-handling plans. It does explain what 코로나맵 is and is otherwise fluent."},"C":{"adequacy":4,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":5,"utility":4,"evidence":["1일까지 누적 조회수는 390만회를 돌파","이틀째 1위","크게 늘어난 코로나맵의 서버 비용도 문제"],"reason":"The summary keeps the main facts: what the site is, the 390만 views, the 500만 forecast, the ranking, the 15 confirmed cases and the server cost issue. It is accurate and fluent. It leaves out the payment plan and the operator's solo workload."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["조만간 누적 조회수가 500만회를 거뜬히 넘을 것 같다","서버를 한 차례 증설","혼자서 코로나맵을 운영"],"reason":"The summary gives the 390만 views, the 500만 forecast, the ranking, the server expansion and the solo operation. It omits the confirmed-case count of 15 and the plan to pay costs privately or add ads. It also turns '넘을 것 같다' into the firmer '넘을 것이라고', which is a minor change. The URL is split across a line break."}}}
